                <li>
                    Start with a legacy Bitcoin P2PKH address:<br>
                    <code>1BgGZ9tcN4rm9KBzDn7KprQz87SZ26SAMH</code>
                </li>
                <li>
                    Perform Base58Check decoding:<br>
                    <code>00751e76e8199196d454941c45d1b3a323f1433bd6</code>
                </li>
                <li>
                    Remove the <code>0x00</code> Bitcoin version byte to obtain the public-key hash:<br>
                    <code>751e76e8199196d454941c45d1b3a323f1433bd6</code>
                </li>
                <li>
                    Add the <code>0x1e</code> Dogecoin P2PKH version byte:<br>
                    <code>1e751e76e8199196d454941c45d1b3a323f1433bd6</code>
                </li>
                <li>
                    Perform Base58Check encoding:<br>
                    <code>DFpN6QqFfUm3gKNaxN6tNcab1FArL9cZLE</code>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

        <div class="accordion-item">
